This file keeps an otherwise-empty directory in git.

`fixture-beta/tasks/done/` has to exist and hold no tasks. A status
directory that is present but empty takes a different path through the
viewer than one that is missing entirely — the missing case drops the
column, the empty case renders it with a zero count — and this is the
fixture's only example of the empty case. `fixture-beta/tasks/backlog/`
covers the missing case by not existing.

Deleting this file deletes that coverage, and nothing will fail to notice.
The name is not `.md`, so the board never sees it as a task.
